{"id": 76878213, "slug": "is-it-time-to-start-worrying-about", "title": "Is it time to start worrying about US economic surveys?", "subtitle": "According to the corporate sector, yes.", "post_date": "2022-10-06T18:10:33.205Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 297, "reaction_count": 0, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 0}, "body_html": "<p>Surveys can be a good way to understand what's going on the economy. </p><p>Below, we made an index which collects a handful of the most important economic surveys / stats for US domestic activity. This is a relatively bearish indicator for the economy.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PrbL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7fb3c02a-ac96-49cd-b881-81bdac617eaa_1522x417.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PrbL!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7fb3c02a-ac96-49cd-b881-81bdac617eaa_1522x417.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PrbL!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7fb3c02a-ac96-49cd-b881-81bdac617eaa_1522x417.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PrbL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7fb3c02a-ac96-49cd-b881-81bdac617eaa_1522x417.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PrbL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3